file lotus/README.md status line synced (ALES82 added, stamp refreshed) — front door current.
recommend keep-going ALES83 the DRIVE family's remaining named shape — a sample-rate decimator (hold each sample across a run, crushing time rather than amplitude — the bit-crush's twin on the other axis). Mechanical, single-module, policy already written; no custody gate.
